    incidentName: Doughy Bounty
    chanceToHappen: 80
    incidentDescription: 'As you reach your destination your caravan passes an abandoned
      baker''s cart by the side of the road which has quite obviously split it''s
      axle and completely thrown one of its wheels, the ring of wood lying splintered
      nearby. The owner seems nowhere to be found.  Whilst salvaging the cart is
      beyond your means, upon further inspection the cart is found to be nearly full,
      what you would guess is some poor baker''s entire delivery.  The cart is fairly
      well sealed, so the breads and other baked goods inside are only mildly stale
      allowing you to restock your own food stores. '
